// ********************************* STAGE 3: THE REVELATION (GOOD ENDING PATH) *********************************

title: Shiekh_Khaled_stage3_Good
---
// Context: He is recovered and sitting up, offering the final guidance.
<<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled nod>>
Old Khaled: You saved an old man today... but the real struggle is yet to come.
Old Khaled: I see a light in you, but it is flickering like a lamp in the wind.

    -> "What do you mean?"
        <<gesture shrug>> 

<<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled wave>>
Old Khaled: The maze you see in your dreams... do not think it is a place of stone and dirt.
Old Khaled: It is the vessel of your own heart.
Old Khaled: The walls are built of your deeds... and the darkness is built of your neglect.

    -> "And the monsters? The shadows?"
        <<gesture lookAway>>

<<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled deny>>
Old Khaled: *Shayateen*... the whisperers.
Old Khaled: They do not fight with swords, young one. They fight with confusion.
Old Khaled: They want you to believe the lie is the truth... and that the bad choice is the good one.
Old Khaled: They capitalize on your *Ghaflah*... your heedlessness.

<<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled cocky>>
// (Cocky used here as the authoritative "Teaching" gesture)
Old Khaled: Listen carefully... at the center of the maze... there is no treasure of gold.
Old Khaled: There is a **Gem of Character**. A jewel of the soul.
Old Khaled: Truthfulness (*Sidq*)... Courage... Kindness.

<<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled nod>>
Old Khaled: To reach it, you must not just fight the shadows... you must ignore their whispers.
Old Khaled: Keep your light bright... for the thief cannot rob a house that is fully awake.
===

// ********************************* STAGE 3: THE DARKNESS (BAD ENDING PATH) *********************************

title: Stage3_Bad_Intro
---
// This plays immediately after the Sheikh dies in Stage 2.
// Usually triggered by a script or an auto-running Yarn node.
(The room feels colder. The shadows in the corners seem to stretch towards you.)
(You feel a heavy weight on your chest. Your Light Level has dropped significantly.)
===

title: Stage3_Bad_Ghost
---
// If the player interacts with the bed after the Sheikh has passed.
(The bed is empty, but the air is thick with regret.)
(You hear a faint whisper... not from the Sheikh, but from something else...)

*Whisper: "You failed him... just like you will fail yourself..."*

(The maze will be darker tonight.)
===